# Raw and intermediate waveform data is never committed — STEAD/INSTANCE
# full-size are ~130GB/~330GB, and even the prototype sample isn't meant to
# live in git. Manifests (small JSON, versioned) ARE committed — see
# src/02_ml_pipeline/manifest.py.
bronze/*
silver/*
gold/*
!bronze/.gitkeep
!silver/.gitkeep
!gold/.gitkeep

*.h5
*.hdf5
*.mseed
*.npy
*.npz
